---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { CheckboxGroup } from "astro-ink";
---
<Base title="CheckboxGroup">
  <div class="docs-page">
    <h1>CheckboxGroup</h1>
    <p class="docs-lede">
      Several choices out of many. Real checkboxes share one form name, so
      selections submit natively. Each change dispatches
      <code>ink:checkboxgroup:change</code> with <code>&#123; values &#125;</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>Example</h2>
    <div class="docs-example">
      <span class="docs-example-label" aria-hidden="true">Example</span>
      <CheckboxGroup
        name="toppings"
        label="Toppings"
        options={["Pepperoni", "Mushrooms", "Olives"]}
        hint="Pick any you like."
      />
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;CheckboxGroup
  name="toppings"
  label="Toppings"
  options=&#123;["Pepperoni", "Mushrooms", "Olives"]&#125;
/&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>With objects and error</h2>
    <div class="docs-example">
      <span class="docs-example-label" aria-hidden="true">With objects and error</span>
      <CheckboxGroup
        name="notify"
        label="Notifications"
        options={[
          { value: "email", label: "Email" },
          { value: "sms", label: "SMS", disabled: true },
          { value: "push", label: "Push" },
        ]}
        error="Pick at least one channel."
        required
      />
    </div>
    <pre class="docs-code"><code>&lt;CheckboxGroup
  name="notify"
  label="Notifications"
  options=&#123;[&#123; value: "email", label: "Email" &#125;, &#123; value: "sms", label: "SMS", disabled: true &#125;]&#125;
  error="Pick at least one channel."
  required
/&gt;</code></pre>

    <h2>Props</h2>
    <table class="docs-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Shared checkbox name; message ids derive from it.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>label</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Legend text.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>options</code></td><td><code>Array&lt;string | &#123; value; label; disabled? &#125;&gt;</code></td><td>-</td><td>Selectable items.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>values</code></td><td><code>string[]</code></td><td><code>[]</code></td><td>Preselected option values.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>hint / error</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Wired via <code>aria-describedby</code> on the fieldset.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>required</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Marks the group required.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>disabled</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Disables every option.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>class</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Style passthrough.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2>Accessibility</h2>
    <ul class="docs-list">
      <li><code>fieldset</code> + <code>legend</code> gives each box its group context.</li>
      <li>Tab moves between options; Space toggles each natively.</li>
      <li>Hint and error link via <code>aria-describedby</code> on the fieldset.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
